        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-28T17:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because I don\u0027t want mk2rbc to become the kitchen sink of starlark conversion. If there\u0027s a clean line to separate across like there is here, I think we should do it.\n\nIf I add this to mk2rbc I also have to make sure it works with all the other flags that could be passed to mk2rbc. Increasing the number of flags to one binary increases the number of permutations to test by 2^flags. (the size of the power set)",
      "parentUuid": "cd772020_52f85305",
      "revId": "a43e273e219f3db488a7dd13f6d0ab103bf27d1d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
