      "writtenOn": "2021-10-29T16:46:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the costs associated with maintaining two separate applications sharing the code are not justified in this case. And what are the other flags that affect emitting variable initialization code?",
      "parentUuid": "75d428ce_0205ff03",
      "revId": "a43e273e219f3db488a7dd13f6d0ab103bf27d1d",
